        "TileImage": "$($repository 90527ca8-b658-4b26-bc0a-9c7018881814).Image",
        "Description": "The Igami organitsatiom is a terror organisation who recently flew a plane into a tower in Dubai. The client has hired us to assasinate two of the six leaders who runs the Igami, they are staying at a hotel in Hong Kong. Their names are Ray Miller who is a mastermind and the reason they havent been caught yet. The other target, Angelinga Kleiner is the brains behind the whole operation and a truly evil human being. You should find them hanging out around the resturant area.\r\rGood luck 47.",
